---
title: Classic Toad in the Hole
description: Sausages baked in a towering, crispy Yorkshire pudding batter, served with rich onion and balsamic gravy.
servings: 4
prep time: 15 minutes
cook time: 50 minutes
source: https://www.jamieoliver.com/recipes/pork/classic-toad-in-the-hole/
image: https://asset.jamieoliver.com/images/cq7w2e71/production/31d091d93453e8252d5073e6d2debf41073f5934-1504x2256.jpg/toadinhole.webp?rect=0,809,1504,1128&w=1200&h=900&fm=webp&q=75&fit=crop&auto=format
